graphy-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4712f2a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4712f2a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-09ca0ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"09ca0ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Alumina continuous fibers are advanced ceramic fibers engineered for high-temperature and demanding environments. These fibers are:<\/p><ul><li><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Highly flexible and capable of being intricately woven into fabrics, ropes, and cloth-like materials.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Resilient at extreme temperatures, making them indispensable for applications like thermal insulation, high-temperature seals, and structural reinforcements.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Known for their exceptional chemical resistance, ensuring stability even in corrosive environments.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-e